 AND REFERENCE VL EXCEEDS V.","#\t\tIN CASE (A),  GOTOADDR  IS SET TO  KEP2  AND IN CASE (B), TO  PREDICT3  SKIPPING THE KEPLER PHASE OF","#\t\tENTRY.","#","# KEP2\t\tGOTOADDR IS SET HERE DURING THE KEPLER PHASE TO MONITOR DRAG.  THE SPACECRAFT IS INSTANTANEOUSLY","#\t\tTRIMMED IN PITCH AND YAW TO THE COMPUTED RELATIVE VELOCITY.  THE LAST COMPUTED ROLL ANGLE IS MAINTAINED.","#\t\tWHEN THE MEASURED DRAG EXCEEDS Q7 +0.5,  GOTOADDR  IS SET TO","#","# PREDICT3\tTHIS CONTROLS THE FINAL SUB-ORBITAL PHASE. ROLL COMMANDS CEASE","#\t\tWHEN  V  IS LESS THAN  VQUIT .  AN EXIT IS MADE TO","#","# P67.1\t\tTHE LAST COMPUTED ROLL ANGLE IS MAINTAINED.  RATE DAMPING IS DONE IN PITCH AND YAW.  PRESENT LATITUDE","#\t\tAND LONGITUDE ARE COMPUTED FOR DISPLAY.","#\t\tENTRY IS TERMINATED WHEN DISKY RESPONSE IS MADE TO TO THIS FINAL FLASHING DISPLAY.","","# Page 848","# PROCESS AVERAGE G OUTPUT...SCALE IT AND GET INPUT DATA","","# * START  TARGETING ...","","\t\tEBANK=\tRTINIT","","\t\t\t\t\t# TARGETNG IS CALLED BY P61, FROM GROUP 4.","\t\t\t\t\t# TARGETNG IS CALLED BY ENTRY, FROM GROUP 5.","","\t\t\t\t\t# ALL MM COME HERE.","TARGETNG\tBOFF\tVLOAD\t\t# ENTER WITH PROPER EB FROM CM/POSE(TEST)","\t\t\tRELVELSW\t# RELVELSW = 96D BIT9","\t\t\tGETVEL\t\t# WANT INERTIAL VEL.  GO GET IT.","\t\t\t-VREL\t\t# NEW V IS RELATIVE, CONTINUE","","\t\tVCOMP\tGOTO\t\t# (VREL) = (V) + KWE UNITR*UNITW","\t\t\tGETUNITV -1\t# - VREL WAS LEFT BY CM/POSE","","GETVEL\t\tVLOAD\tVXSC\t\t# INERTIAL V WANTED","\t\t\tVN\t\t# KVSCALE = (12800 / .3048) / 2VS","\t\t\tKVSCALE\t\t# KVSCALE = .81491944","\t\tSTORE\tVEL\t\t# V/2 VS","","GETUNITV\tUNIT\tSTQ","\t\t\t60GENRET","\t\tSTODL\tUNITV","\t\t\t34D","\t\tSTORE\tVSQUARE\t\t# VSQ/4","","\t\tDSU\t\t\t# LEQ = VSQUARE - 1","\t\t\tFOURTH\t\t# 4 G-S FULL SCALE","\t\tSTODL\tLEQ\t\t# LEQ/4","","\t\t\t36D","\t\tSTOVL\tV\t\t# V/2 VS = VEL/2 VS","","\t\t\tVEL","\t\tDOT\tSL1\t\t# RDOT= V.UNITR","\t\t\tUNITR","\t\tSTOVL\tRDOT\t\t# RDOT /2 VS","","\t\t\tDELV\t\t# PIPA COUNTS IN PLATFO